# Lockout on the routes that confirm the current password: the fifth wrong password locks the account for 15 minutes
# (429 lockout_active), then change-password and DELETE /api/profile stay 429 while login answers the uniform 401. Only a disposable mechanic is ever locked.

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@AdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@AdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@TestPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_PASSWORD}}
@TestWrongPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WRONG_PASSWORD}}
@NewPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_NEW_PASSWORD}}
@RunId = {{$timestamp}}
@LockoutMechanicEmail = credential.lockout.{{RunId}}@example.test

### [Setup][Lockout] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][Lockout] Login as admin (200 expected)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Lockout] Register the disposable mechanic that gets locked out (200 expected)
# @name lockoutMechanic
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Credential", "lastName": "Lockout", "email": "{{LockoutMechanicEmail}}", "password": "{{TestPassword}}", "personType": "Mechanic", "specialization": "GasolineAndDiesel", "expertise": ["Engine"] }

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Lockout] Login as the disposable mechanic (200 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{LockoutMechanicEmail}}", "password": "{{TestPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Negative][Lockout] Four wrong current passwords are refused one by one, each counting toward the lockout (400 expected each)
# @loop for 4
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/change-password
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "{{TestWrongPassword}}", "newPassword": "{{NewPassword}}", "confirmNewPassword": "{{NewPassword}}" }

?? status == 400

###

### [Negative][Lockout] The fifth wrong password locks the account (429 expected, code lockout_active)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/change-password
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "{{TestWrongPassword}}", "newPassword": "{{NewPassword}}", "confirmNewPassword": "{{NewPassword}}" }

?? status == 429
?? js response.parsedBody.code == lockout_active

###

### [Negative][Lockout] Even the correct current password is refused during the lockout (429 expected, code lockout_active)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/change-password
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "{{TestPassword}}", "newPassword": "{{NewPassword}}", "confirmNewPassword": "{{NewPassword}}" }

?? status == 429
?? js response.parsedBody.code == lockout_active
?? js response.parsedBody.retryAfterSeconds > 0

###

### [Negative][Lockout] Self-delete with the correct password is refused during the lockout (429 expected, code lockout_active)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "{{TestPassword}}" }

?? status == 429
?? js response.parsedBody.code == lockout_active
?? js response.parsedBody.retryAfterSeconds > 0

###

### [Negative][Lockout] A locked-out identity cannot refresh its session (401 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Lockout] Login of the locked-out account answers the uniform invalid-credentials problem, never 429 (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{LockoutMechanicEmail}}", "password": "{{TestPassword}}" }

?? status == 401
?? js response.parsedBody.title == invalid_credentials
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Invalid login credentials.") == true

###

### [Cleanup][Lockout] Login as admin again to delete the locked-out mechanic (200 expected)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Cleanup][Lockout] Admin deletes the locked-out mechanic (200 expected, a lockout does not block the delete)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{lockoutMechanic.personId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 200
